Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 19:16:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Test FA4 paged KV on SM90 with tile_n below the loader's
 128 threads

Head dim 256 (tile 128 x 80) against an FP32 reference over a shuffled
page table: page size 1, causal and not; page size 16, causal. Head dim
128 (page size 1, causal) as the unchanged control. Skipped unless SM90.
---
